@10200002 = ~Guardian~ //Guardian: Mixed Case Kit Name
@10200003 = ~GUARDIAN:

Advantages:
– The closest enemy in a 30-ft. radius is marked, receives a -2 penalty to hit and damage.
– May use Donate per day. Gains one use at level 1 and an extra use every 4 levels.

DONATE: The target is healed 5 Hit Points and the Guardian loses the same amount. At level 5, 

– May use Bulwark once per day.

BULWARK: This spell affects a chosen target within a 30-ft. radius and the Guardian <PRO_HIMHER>self. Affected targets gain 15% resistance to physical damage, a +1 bonus to saving throws, 

– 

Disadvantages:
– Alignment restricted to non-evil.
– -2 penalty to damage
– May not wield any two-handed weapons.
– -4 penalty to hit with any off-hand weapon~ //Guardian: Kit Description - Vanilla
@10200003 = ~Marked~

@10200010 = ~The Guardian has withstood countless battles and enormous pain. ~

