@10300000 = ~Install Halfling Marshal - Fighter kit~ //Halfling Marshal: Install Kit Component
@10300001 = ~halfling marshal~ //Halfling Marshal: Lower Case Kit Name
@10300002 = ~Halfling Marshal~ //Halfling Marshal: Mixed Case Kit Name
@10300003 = ~HALFLING MARSHAL: Not all halflings are content to enjoy peace and quiet in their townships. The Halfling Marshal acts as sheriff and army commander in, around, and beyond <PRO_HISHER> community, giving a proactive and protective face for the short folk.

Advantages:
– Receives a +1 bonus to all Saving Throws.
– May use the Adrenaline Rush ability once per day. Gains one use at level 1.

ADRENALINE RUSH: The marshal is healed 1 hit point per level, and <PRO_HESHE> is also hasted for 5 rounds. At level 10 the haste effect turns into an improved haste effect.

– May use the Focus Formation ability once per day. Gains one use at level 1, one use at level 4, and an additional use every 4 levels thereafter.

FOCUS FORMATION: All allies in a 30-ft. radius centred on the marshal gain a +1 bonus to-hit and damage rolls for every other ally within a 15-ft. radius of themselves. This bonus lasts for 1 turn.

Disadvantages:
– Race restricted to halfling.
– Alignment restricted to good.
– May not wield any two-handed weapons, except for shortbows.~ //Halfling Marshal: Kit Description - Vanilla

@10300004 = ~Adrenaline Rush~ //Halfling Marshal: Ability 1 Name
@10300005 = ~Adrenaline Rush
The marshal is healed 1 hit point per level, and <PRO_HESHE> is also hasted for 5 rounds. At level 10 the haste effect turns into an improved haste effect.~ //Halfling Marshal: Ability 1 Description
@10300006 = ~Healed~ //Halfling Marshal: Ability 1 Effect Text
@10300007 = ~Hasted~ //Halfling Marshal: Ability 1 Effect Text

@10300008 = ~Focus Formation~ //Halfling Marshal: Ability 2 Name
@10300009 = ~Focus Formation
All allies in a 30-ft. radius centred on the marshal gain a +1 bonus to hit and damage rolls for every other ally within a 15-ft. radius of themselves. This bonus lasts for 1 turn.~ //Halfling Marshal: Ability 2 Description
@10300010 = ~Formation Bonus~ //Halfling Marshal: Ability 2 Effect Text

@10300011 = ~Arvoreen's Blessing~ //Halfling Marshal: High Level Ability Name
@10300012 = ~Arvoreen's Blessing
Arvoreen imbues the Marshal with the strength of one of his honored dead, giving the marshal a +6 bonus to hit and damage, and a +4 bonus to <PRO_HISHER> Armor Class and saving throws for 5 rounds. All allies in a 30-ft radius of the marshal receive the same bonus but at half strength.~ //Halfling Marshal: High Level Ability Description
@10300013 = ~Keeper's Strength~ //Halfling Marshal: High Level Ability Effect Text
@10300014 = ~Keeper's Presence~ //Halfling Marshal: High Level Ability Effect Text

@10300015 = ~Although the life of a warrior has always held your heart, the mines of your dwarven home have chafed at your spirit. You have tired of constantly beating back the same hordes of drow and goblins, and these days it sometimes seemed that you couldn't raise your shield without some young upstart crashing into you from behind. Perhaps it was for this reason you chose to head to the North, where stories of old warriors and heroes call to mind a simpler time of honor and glory. Perhaps in the shadow of the Spine of the World, you can find some measure of the valor that is missing from your home.~

