While this cartridge is loaded, the Arsenal gains a -6 penalty to damage with missile weapons. This penalty stacks with other cartridge penalties loaded.~
@10800016 = ~Heavy Cartridge~
@10800017 = ~All successful ranged attacks have the following effects beside normal damage, according to the level of the Arsenal:
 7th level: 10% chance to stun for 1 second. Save vs. Death with a +2 bonus to negate.
 11th level: 20% chance to stun for 1 second. Save vs. Death to negate.
 15th level: 20% chance to stun for 2 seconds. Save vs. Death to negate.
 19th level: 35% chance to stun for 2 seconds. Save vs. Death to negate.

While this cartridge is loaded, the Arsenal gains a -4 penalty to hit with missile weapons. This penalty stacks with other cartridge penalties loaded.~
