@40100003 = ~DEFENDER~ //Defender: Upper Case Kit Name
@40100004 = ~A member of a special sect within the druidic order, a Druid of this type is dedicated to preserving those who would protect nature. At the expense of some of <PRO_HISHER> druidic talents, a Defender has come into communion with the deities of the natural world to gain special abilities and rituals.~ //Defender: Kit Description
@40100005 = ~Advantages:
– +2 bonus to Strength, Dexterity and Constitution
– Seven cleric spells are added to <PRO_HISHER> repertoire, all the way up to 7th level. These are listed below:
 1st level: %bonus_spell_lvl_1%
 2nd level: %bonus_spell_lvl_2%
 3rd level: %bonus_spell_lvl_3%
 4th level: %bonus_spell_lvl_4%
 5th level: %bonus_spell_lvl_5%
 6th level: %bonus_spell_lvl_6%
 7th level: %bonus_spell_lvl_7%
 
Disadvantages:
– Cannot use Shapeshift.
– May not use scimitars, daggers, spears or darts.~ //Defender: Kit Ability Block - Vanilla
@40100006 = ~Advantages:
– +2 bonus to Strength, Dexterity and Constitution

Disadvantages:
– Cannot use Shapeshift.
– May not use scimitars, daggers, spears or darts.~//Defender: Kit Ability Block - Divine Remix - Spheres
@40100007 = ~Choose Defender Version:
v1:
 1st level: Sanctuary
 2nd level: Aid
 3rd level: Remove Paralysis
 4th level: Lesser Restoration
 5th level: Raise Dead
 6th level: Bolt of Glory
 7th level: Greater Restoration

v2 (recommended):
 1st level: Resist Fear
 2nd level: Aid
 3rd level: Remove Curse
 4th level: Divine Power
 5th level: Raise Dead
 6th level: Bolt of Glory
 7th level: Greater Restoration
PLEASE ENTER 1 or 2.~

