@70100000 = ~Install Tamed Sorcerer Kit~
@70100001 = ~tamed sorcerer~
@70100002 = ~Tamed Sorcerer~
@70100003 = ~TAMED SORCERER: Tamed Sorcerers go through intense training and practice in order to master the turbulent power inside them. The end result of this has resulted in a more deliberate spell casting technique and the ability to transform raw magical energy into specific spells.

Advantages:
– May cast the spell Arcane Conversion at every spell level starting from 2nd-level.

Disadvantages:
– Spell casting time increased by 2.
– May not be chaotic.~
@70100004 = ~Arcane Conversion I~
@70100005 = ~Arcane Conversion I
(Invocation/Evocation)

Level: 2
Range: Special
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

A Tamed Sorcerer can focus their innate power into a specific spell as a result of <HISHER> study, whether formally known or unknown. A portion of magical energy equivalent to one spell level is consumed in order for this to occur and thus the spell cast must be an effect one spell level lower than the actual level of magical energy used.

Casting this spell results in a 1st level spell using a 2nd level spell slot.~
@70100006 = ~Arcane Conversion II~
@70100005 = ~Arcane Conversion II
(Invocation/Evocation)

Level: 3
Range: Special
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

A Tamed Sorcerer can focus their innate power into a specific spell as a result of <HISHER> study, whether formally known or unknown. A portion of magical energy equivalent to one spell level is consumed in order for this to occur and thus the spell cast must be an effect one spell level lower than the actual level of magical energy used.

Casting this spell results in a 2nd level spell using a 3rd level spell slot.~
@70100008 = ~Arcane Conversion III~
@70100005 = ~Arcane Conversion III
(Invocation/Evocation)

Level: 4
Range: Special
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

A Tamed Sorcerer can focus their innate power into a specific spell as a result of <HISHER> study, whether formally known or unknown. A portion of magical energy equivalent to one spell level is consumed in order for this to occur and thus the spell cast must be an effect one spell level lower than the actual level of magical energy used.

Casting this spell results in a 3rd level spell using a 4th level spell slot.~
@70100010 = ~Arcane Conversion IV~
@70100005 = ~Arcane Conversion IV
(Invocation/Evocation)

Level: 5
Range: Special
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

A Tamed Sorcerer can focus their innate power into a specific spell as a result of <HISHER> study, whether formally known or unknown. A portion of magical energy equivalent to one spell level is consumed in order for this to occur and thus the spell cast must be an effect one spell level lower than the actual level of magical energy used.

Casting this spell results in a 4th level spell using a 5th level spell slot.~
@70100012 = ~Arcane Conversion V~
@70100005 = ~Arcane Conversion IV
(Invocation/Evocation)

Level: 6
Range: Special
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

A Tamed Sorcerer can focus their innate power into a specific spell as a result of <HISHER> study, whether formally known or unknown. A portion of magical energy equivalent to one spell level is consumed in order for this to occur and thus the spell cast must be an effect one spell level lower than the actual level of magical energy used.

Casting this spell results in a 5th level spell using a 6th level spell slot.~
@70100014 = ~Arcane Conversion VI~
@70100005 = ~Arcane Conversion VI
(Invocation/Evocation)

Level: 7
Range: Special
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

A Tamed Sorcerer can focus their innate power into a specific spell as a result of <HISHER> study, whether formally known or unknown. A portion of magical energy equivalent to one spell level is consumed in order for this to occur and thus the spell cast must be an effect one spell level lower than the actual level of magical energy used.

Casting this spell results in a 6th level spell using a 7th level spell slot.~
@70100016 = ~Arcane Conversion VII~
@70100005 = ~Arcane Conversion VII
(Invocation/Evocation)

Level: 8
Range: Special
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

A Tamed Sorcerer can focus their innate power into a specific spell as a result of <HISHER> study, whether formally known or unknown. A portion of magical energy equivalent to one spell level is consumed in order for this to occur and thus the spell cast must be an effect one spell level lower than the actual level of magical energy used.

Casting this spell results in a 7th level spell using a 8th level spell slot.~
@70100018 = ~Arcane Conversion VIII~
@70100005 = ~Arcane Conversion VIII
(Invocation/Evocation)

Level: 9
Range: Special
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
