A Tamed Sorcerer can focus their innate power into a specific spell as a result of <HISHER> study, whether formally known or unknown. A portion of magical energy equivalent to one spell level is consumed in order for this to occur and thus the spell cast must be an effect one spell level lower than the actual level of magical energy used.

Casting this spell results in a 8th level spell using a 9th level spell slot.~
@70100018 = ~Arcane Hyperconversion~
@70100018 = ~Arcane Hyperconversion
(Invocation/Evocation)

Level: Quest
Range: Special
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

A more powerful version of a regular Arcane Conversion. The Tamed Sorcerer uses a portion of their own health in order to succeed, but the result is a spell that some wizards take their whole lives to learn and cast.

Casting this spell results in a 9th level spell using an innate spell slot and 3d4 hit points.~

